# Contact Management System

A simple REST API-based Contact Management System developed using **Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and Mongoose**.

The application allows users to create, view, update, and delete contacts with proper validation for contact ID, phone number, and email address.

---

## Features

- Create a new contact
- View all contacts
- View a contact by ID
- Update an existing contact
- Delete a contact
- Unique Contact ID validation
- Required name validation
- Exactly 10-digit phone number validation
- Valid email format validation
- Unique email validation
- MongoDB database integration using Mongoose
- Environment variable support using dotenv

---

## Technologies Used

- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- dotenv
- Nodemon
- JavaScript
- Postman / Thunder Client for API testing

